WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.551
In one minute, you will sign up for one email a week with the lights near you.

00:00:04.551 --> 00:00:05.601
We start on the map.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.792
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:14.135
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:16.634
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:17.985
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.751 --> 00:00:22.120
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:22.816
Tap Allow.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.786
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:29.786 --> 00:00:30.941
See the three dots?

00:00:30.941 --> 00:00:31.460
Tap them.

00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:35.911
In the menu, tap Weekly lights email.

00:00:37.651 --> 00:00:40.028
Type your email address, and your city.

00:00:40.028 --> 00:00:41.633
Then tick the box to agree.

00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:46.041
Tap Sign up.

00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:50.281
We send you an email to confirm.

00:00:50.281 --> 00:00:52.201
Nothing is sent until you do.

00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:53.417
Tap the link in it.

00:00:55.512 --> 00:00:56.277
That is it.

00:00:56.277 --> 00:00:59.148
Every weekly email ends with a link to stop.

00:00:59.148 --> 00:01:01.317
One tap, and you are off the list.

00:01:02.522 --> 00:01:05.645
Next up: Install the app and use it offline.
